  "semantic_slots": {
    "objects": "Actual Gibbs mu, Gaussian J, nu=J.snd, exchangeable reflection pair Lambda, every-y reflected-density S; actual P onto snd-measurable L2(J), U reflection pullback, M snd embedding, T bounded mean class; A=PUP and B=(1-P)UP explicitly authored aliases.",
    "domains": "True real Lp2 quotient classes and their selected AE representatives under actual probabilities; fiber L1(u)/L1(u^2) and variance L1(nu) internally produced. No compactness/positivity/centering of L2 input or measure/domain certificate.",
    "quantifiers": "One source mu/J/nu/Lambda/S/U/M/T before forall u:Lp2(nu). Every-y S density equality; Lambda disintegration and marginals exact measures; rough mean equality and both fiber integrability assertions only nu-AE. No uniform common exceptional set over all u is claimed.",
    "assumptions": "Five finite real Hilbert/Borel ambient classes; V C2; alpha,beta nonnegative real typing with 0<alpha<=beta; global Hessian bounds; eta>0 and beta*eta<=1. All other semantic ingredients are conclusions, not supplied inputs.",
    "conclusion": "Actual probabilities/Markov S/disintegration, U/M/T coherent reflection/projection/mean, contraction and exact integrated conditional variance=||BMu||^2=||u||^2-||Tu||^2. No gradient, H1, Gamma, C1-everywhere-rough or B13 conclusion.",
    "scopes": "Authored all-L2 B1/B9 source mean bridge needed by later density/difference/closed-gradient passage. Not a separately printed standalone theorem; no source C2 gradient estimate or main/cost/composition completion.",
    "constant_dependencies": "stdGaussian variance1; sqrt(eta) in joint map; actual reflection2; inverse half(y+x); reflected denominator8eta; exact isometries/norm defect coefficient1. No posterior/reflected law or scale identification."
  },
